# What must not enter a build context.
#
# The context is this whole metaproject, because an image needs both a component and the
# contracts it is generated from and validated against. Everything below is either enormous,
# machine-specific, or both — a host virtualenv copied into an image is a set of binaries built
# for the host's libc, and the image would work until the day somebody built it elsewhere.

**/.venv
.venv-e2e
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.git
**/.DS_Store

# The testbed's own output, and the one directory that is only ever read by a person.
.testbed
docs/
